  "kind": "resolution-paper",
  "original_status": "proved",
  "scope": "Over F_11, for f(x)=x^4 and g(x)=x^8 with S_h and Gamma_h exactly as defined in source.md, the projectivity induced by M=((1,0,0),(0,0,1),(0,1,0)) maps S_f onto S_g, while no invertible affine transformation of F_11^2 maps Gamma_f onto Gamma_g; hence f and g are projectively equivalent but not CCZ-equivalent.",
